condition_1- "Shift+Enter visibly inserts a newline into the current shell command without execution";
condition_2- "Plain Enter continues to execute the command normally";
condition_3- "Normal readline editing and terminal control keys remain functional";
condition_4- "Interactive PTY applications remain usable without a duplicate OperatorShell command buffer";
condition_5- "A Python heredoc can be entered interactively without && chaining";
condition_6- "Multiline [< code] can later use the same terminal interaction";
condition_7- "The proven behavior is documented as CE-OS semantic authority rather than a permanent Bash-specific dependency";
);
);


);
);
